Not only got rid of the ball and chain, but am now GROG! the Hand of Elbereth!
(though I destroyed my first batch of holy water when I dropped it while
 levitating *pout*. had to wish for some more)
Used the wand up wishing for a shield of reflection, and 3 blessed
scrolls of genocide (have used one to wipe out 'L'), blessed the lamp,
