Found out (the hard way) that you can't 'recharge' magic lamps anymore  8(
Killed an orc and got a spellbook of identify. And after countless
failures (9int, 11wis) managed to 'read' it twice. Much better then
trying to find scrolls.
Finally id'd all those rings and amulets I"d been packing about.
(am making good use of my uncursed ring of hunger)
A magic whistle is great for robbing shops when you're invisible and
can't get in!  =)
Managed to rustproof my helm of telepethy! *yay*!
Hit a throne room on level 14, got a wish from sitting, and
